text = "W/A/S/D: move    Left/Right: turn    Up/Down: look\nSpace (hold while moving on ground): boost dash\nSpace (press while standing still): jump (free)\nWhile airborne, hold Space: air boost (dash + jump combined)\nRelease during dash, then re-press quickly: launch into an air boost\nB: Overed Boost (OB-core only) -- 1s charge, then multiplies your\ncurrent movement as long as you keep moving. B again (or stopping)\nends it; on the ground that means braking to a halt first."
